 month.","https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/datasets/inspire/download"],["HMLR","LOCAL_AUTHORITY_DOWNLOAD","Current INSPIRE files are downloadable by local authority.","https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/datasets/inspire/download"],["HMLR","LAMBETH_LISTED","London Borough of Lambeth is present in the current local-authority download list.","https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/datasets/inspire/download"],["HMLR","OGL_DOWNLOAD_CONDITIONS","The current download page states download is subject to Open Government Licence conditions.","https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/datasets/inspire/download"],["HMLR","FREEHOLD_SCOPE","INSPIRE Index Polygons contain locations of freehold registered property in England and Wales.","https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/datasets/inspire"],["HMLR","INDEX_POLYGON_SUBSET","INSPIRE Index Polygons are a subset of HMLR's wider Index Polygons database.","https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/datasets/inspire"],["HMLR","UNIQUE_INSPIRE_ID","Each INSPIRE Index Polygon has a unique Land Registry-INSPIRE ID related to a registered title.","https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/datasets/inspire"],["HMLR","INDICATIVE_EXTENT_ONLY","HMLR states INSPIRE polygons show indicative position and extent, not definitive title extent.","https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/datasets/inspire"],["HMLR","TITLE_PLAN_REQUIRED_FOR_EXACT_EXTENT","HMLR states exact land extent for a registered title can only be identified from the individual title plan.","https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/datasets/inspire"],["HMLR","ONE_TITLE_MULTIPLE_POLYGONS","A single registered title can contain several separate polygons, each with a separate INSPIRE ID.","https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/datasets/inspire"],["HMLR","LEASEHOLD_ABSENCE_POSSIBLE","A property without an INSPIRE ID may be leasehold or another tenure omitted from this INSPIRE subset.","https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/datasets/inspire"],["HMLR","BNG_CAPTURE","HMLR technical guidance states the data is captured against British National Grid.","https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/datasets/inspire/tech-guidance"],["HMLR","REPROJECTION_SHIFT_WARNING","HMLR warns BNG-to-WGS84 reprojection can shift some features by up to 15 metres.","https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/datasets/inspire/tech-guidance"],["HMLR","FIND_PROPERTY_ID_USE","HMLR says an INSPIRE ID can be used with Find a Property to obtain title registration and plan information.","https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/datasets/inspire"],["Environment Agency","DTM1_COVERAGE","LIDAR Composite DTM 1m covers about 99% of England.","https://environment.data.gov.uk/dataset/13787b9a-26a4-4775-8523-806d13af58fc"],["Environment Agency","DTM1_RESOLUTION","The composite DTM spatial resolution is 1 metre.","https://environment.data.gov.uk/dataset/13787b9a-26a4-4775-8523-806d13af58fc"],["Environment Agency","BARE_EARTH_MODEL","The DTM removes surface objects to model the terrain surface.","https://environment.data.gov.uk/dataset/13787b9a-26a4-4775-8523-806d13af58fc"],["Environment Agency","SURVEY_LINEAGE","The composite combines Time Stamped archive and National LIDAR Programme surveys.","https://environment.data.gov.uk/dataset/13787b9a-26a4-4775-8523-806d13af58fc"],["Environment Agency","NEWEST_BEST_RESOLUTION","Where repeat surveys exist, the newest and best-resolution data is used.","https://environment.data.gov.uk/dataset/13787b9a-26a4-4775-8523-806d13af58fc"],["Environment Agency","BILINEAR_RESAMPLING","Where data was resampled, the dataset description says bilinear interpolation was used.","https://environment.data.gov.uk/dataset/13787b9a-26a4-4775-8523-806d13af58fc"],["Environment Agency","SOURCE_SURVEY_PERIOD","The 2022 composite contains surveys undertaken from 6 June 2000 to 2 April 2022.","https://environment.data.gov.uk/dataset/13787b9a-26a4-4775-8523-806d13af58fc"],["Environment Agency","VERTICAL_ACCURACY","Individual LIDAR surveys used in the composite have vertical accuracy of ±15 cm RMSE.","https://environment.data.gov.uk/dataset/13787b9a-26a4-4775-8523-806d13af58fc"],["Environment Agency","CRS_EPSG27700","Dataset metadata declares EPSG:27700.","https://environment.data.gov.uk/dataset/13787b9a-26a4-4775-8523-806d13af58fc"],["Environment Agency","GEOTIFF_5KM_TILES","The dataset is available as GeoTIFF rasters in 5 km tiles aligned to the OS National Grid.","https://www.data.gov.uk/dataset/01b3ee39-da3f-47b6-83da-dc98e73a461f/lidar-composite-digital-terrain-model-dtm-1m"],["Environment Agency","ODN_METRES","Data is presented in metres referenced to Ordnance Survey Newlyn.","https://www.data.gov.uk/dataset/01b3ee39-da3f-47b6-83da-dc98e73a461f/lidar-composite-digital-terrain-model-dtm-1m"],["Environment Agency","OSTN15_METHOD","Data.gov.uk metadata states the OSTN15 transformation method is used.","https://www.data.gov.uk/dataset/01b3ee39-da3f-47b6-83da-dc98e73a461f/lidar-composite-digital-terrain-model-dtm-1m"],["Environment Agency","WCS_AVAILABLE","The Environment Agency dataset advertises a WCS endpoint for the 1m DTM.","https://environment.data.gov.uk/dataset/13787b9a-26a4-4775-8523-806d13af58fc"],["Environment Agency","WCS_RAW_PIXEL_ELEVATION","EA guidance states WCS returns raw pixel data such as elevation.","https://environment.data.gov.uk/support/announcements/275811447/275811543"],["Environment Agency","WCS_VERSION_201","EA states its WCS services use OGC WCS version 2.0.1.","https://environment.data.gov.uk/support/announcements/275811447/275811543"],["Environment Agency","WCS_NODATA_SENTINEL","EA guidance states WCS GeoTIFF NoData is -3.4028235e+38.","https://environment.data.gov.uk/support/announcements/275811447/275811543"],["Environment Agency","OGC_FEATURES_DTM_EXTENTS","The survey-index OGC Features service lists LIDAR_Composite_1m_DTM_2022_extents in EPSG:27700.","https://environment.data.gov.uk/geoservices/datasets/9f0fa3fc-a860-4729-adc9-47fe53f658d0/ogc/features/v1/collections"],["Environment Agency","OGC_DTM_QUERYABLES","The DTM extents collection exposes filename, tilename, polygon_id, resolution, year, od_dtm_fn, survey dates and geometry as queryable fields.","https://environment.data.gov.uk/geoservices/datasets/9f0fa3fc-a860-4729-adc9-47fe53f658d0/ogc/features/v1/collections"],["Ordnance Survey","OPEN_DATA","OS Terrain 50 is an Open Data product.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50/os-terrain-50-overview"],["Ordnance Survey","FREE_USE_SCOPE","OS states Terrain 50 is free to view, download and use for commercial, educational and personal purposes.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50/os-terrain-50-overview"],["Ordnance Survey","GB_COVERAGE","OS Terrain 50 covers Great Britain.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50"],["Ordnance Survey","ANNUAL_JULY","OS Terrain 50 is updated annually in July.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50"],["Ordnance Survey","GRID_AND_CONTOUR","OS Terrain 50 is published as both grid data and contour data.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50"],["Ordnance Survey","TEN_KM_TILES","Grid and contour data are supplied as 10 km by 10 km tiles.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50"],["Ordnance Survey","FIFTY_M_POST_SPACING","The Terrain 50 grid uses regular 50 m post spacing.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50"],["Ordnance Survey","GRID_200_BY_200","A 10 km grid tile is represented by 200 by 200 pixels.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50/os-terrain-50-technical-specification/grid-data"],["Ordnance Survey","PIXEL_CENTRE_HEIGHT","Grid height values are calculated from the centre of each pixel.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50/os-terrain-50-technical-specification/grid-data"],["Ordnance Survey","HEIGHT_NEAREST_0_1M","Height values are supplied to the nearest 0.1 m.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50/os-terrain-50-technical-specification/grid-data"],["Ordnance Survey","ASCII_GRID_FORMAT","Grid data is available in ASCII grid format.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50/os-terrain-50-technical-specification"],["Ordnance Survey","GML_GRID_METADATA","The gridded supply includes GML alongside ASCII data.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50/os-terrain-50-technical-specification/grid-data"],["Ordnance Survey","PER_TILE_METADATA","OS Terrain 50 includes per-tile metadata in GEMINI-style XML.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50/os-terrain-50-technical-specification/metadata"],["Ordnance Survey","NO_REGISTRATION_SUPPLY","OS states the online download is available with no registration required.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50/os-terrain-50-overview/product-supply"],["Ordnance Survey","TILE_COUNT_2858","The national tiled supply contains 2,858 tiles.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50/os-terrain-50-overview/product-supply"],["Ordnance Survey","FOLDER_COUNT_55","The tiled national supply is arranged into 55 folders representing 100 km grid squares.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50/os-terrain-50-overview/product-supply"],["Ordnance Survey","GRID_SUPPLY_157_MB","OS documents the full national grid supply as 157 MB compressed.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50/os-terrain-50-overview/product-supply"],["Ordnance Survey","GRID_RMSE_4M","OS Terrain 50 grid data is documented as 4 m RMSE.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50/os-terrain-50-overview"],["Ordnance Survey","NO_LIVE_KNOWN_ISSUES","The current known-data-issues page states there are no live known issues.","https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/land-and-terrain-portfolio/os-terrain-50/os-terrain-50-known-data-issues"],["Ordnance Survey","DOWNLOADS_API_TQ_REDIRECT","OS Downloads API supports area=TQ filtering and returns HTTP 307 when redirect is requested and exactly one file matches.","https://docs.os.uk/os-apis/accessing-os-apis/os-downloads-api/technical-specification/download-an-opendata-product"]],"candidate_records":{"61536":{"row":61536,"hmlr":"36760596","authority":"Lambeth","e":529209.089,"n":169949.549,"lat":51.4138507,"lon":-0.1434117,"tile":"TQ26","col":184,"row_from_north":1,"cell_center_e":529225.0,"cell_center_n":169925.0,"cell_offset_m":29.254},"61537":{"row":61537,"hmlr":"36758146","authority":"Lambeth","e":529197.094,"n":170094.802,"lat":51.4151588,"lon":-0.1435312,"tile":"TQ27","col":183,"row_from_north":198,"source_only_m":28.2,"cell_center_e":529175.0,"cell_center_n":170075.0,"cell_offset_m":29.669},"61538":{"row":61538,"hmlr":"36781190","authority":"Lambeth","e":529264.73,"n":170045.496,"lat":51.4147003,"lon":-0.1425771,"tile":"TQ27","col":185,"row_from_north":199,"source_only_m":27.5,"cell_center_e":529275.0,"cell_center_n":170025.0,"cell_offset_m":22.925},"61539":{"row":61539,"hmlr":"36776765","authority":"Lambeth","e":529293.92,"n":170098.724,"lat":51.415172,"lon":-0.1421382,"tile":"TQ27","col":185,"row_from_north":198,"source_only_m":27.0,"cell_center_e":529275.0,"cell_center_n":170075.0,"cell_offset_m":30.345}},"candidate_guard_template":{"pass_checks":["CANONICAL_ROW_PIN","HMLR_INSPIRE_ID_PIN","LOCAL_AUTHORITY_PIN","BNG_COORDINATE_PIN","WGS84_COORDINATE_PIN","TERRAIN50_TILE_PIN","TILE_SW_ORIGIN_ARITHMETIC","COLUMN_ARITHMETIC","ROW_FROM_NORTH_ARITHMETIC","CELL_CENTRE_ARITH